26-07-28</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/pranee54/AgentDoctor\">AgentDoctor</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Local CLI tool that audits AI coding agent configurations for security vulnerabilities, exposed environment files, private keys, MCP filesystem scopes, and context waste. Works with Cursor, Claude Code, and Codex environments without API keys.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category-tag\">AI security tool</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span>2026-07-28</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/TheWariend/CleanSlate\">CleanSlate</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Open-source coding agent for IDE, CLI, and SDK environments. VS Code-based agent fork with Execution mode for building and Plan mode for read-only analysis, supporting multiple AI providers with 59 built-in tools.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category-tag\">AI coding agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span>2026-07-27</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/mikehasa/agentacct\">agentacct</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Local-first agent work intelligence dashboard that monitors coding agent activity. Reads session logs from Claude Code, Codex, and OpenCode, displaying token usage, costs, work steps, and file changes with privacy-focused localhost architecture.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category-tag\">AI monitoring tool</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span>2026-07-24</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/24KaratAu/openhub\">openhub</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Keyboard-first terminal UI discovery hub and package installer for AI coding tools, skills, and agents. Features fuzzy search, curated collections, and universal skill export compatible with multiple AI coding environments.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category-tag\">AI tools package manager</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span>2026-07-23</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/finna/Finn-loop\">Finn-loop</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Three-skill AI software factory for Claude Code that integrates Linear and GitHub. Workflow: finn-spec interviews and files issues, finn-build implements and opens PRs, finn-review posts verdicts. Humans retain final merge authority.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category-tag\">AI workflow automation</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span>2026-07-22</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/dark-ps/DarkPs-Agent-CLI\">DarkPs-Agent-CLI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Extensible local-first AI agent framework for project workspaces, developer tooling, and MCP integration. Features automatic workspace interpretation, self-registering tools, persistent memory, and support for both cloud and local models.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category-tag\">AI coding agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span>2026-07-22</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss\">bbarit-agent-oss</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Open-source AI coding agent CLI tool written in Rust, shipping as a single static binary. Supports 15+ LLM providers with 1,000+ models, semantic code search, 295 curated personas, project wiki, and auto-memory system.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category-tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span>2026-07-21</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/risa-labs-inc/BossConsole\">BossConsole</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Multi-platform harness for AI agents built with Kotlin running on JVM. Provides Claude Code, Codex, Gemini, and OpenCode with real tools including embedded browser, terminal, code editor, secrets management, and MCP automation.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category-tag\">AI agent harness</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span>2026-07-21</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/surya-koritala/sigbound\">sigbound</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Tool for running multiple AI coding agents on one repository in parallel with automatic merging. Lands only changes that build and pass tests, addressing the 30-50% time developers spend on conflict resolution with parallel agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"category-tag\">AI workflow automation</span>\n                        <span class=\"source-tag\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span>2026-07-21</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/rengwu/chartr\">chartr</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Agent multiplexer combining terminal multiplexing with visual work mapping. Renders